  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PE - LIVESTOCK SUPPORT PROGRAMME IN THE NORTHERN COMMUNAL AREAS OF NAMIBIA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of the programme is to promote the entrepreneurship and enhance the livelihood of Northern Communal Areas (NCA) livestock farming communities in a sustainable way.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
